  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If two vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are perpendicular, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8869;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p>Put the value from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;to get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;but given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are coplanar and we know that the three vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are coplanar, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
